## Article 11. Appeals to associations of citizens

```catala
declaration scope Article11AssociationAppeals:
  input appealType content AppealType
  input addressee content AddresseeType
  input isStatutoryActivity content YesNo
  input rightsViolatedByAssociation content YesNo
  output reviewedByAssociation content YesNo
  output reviewedUnderThisLaw content YesNo

scope Article11AssociationAppeals:
  label statutory_exception default_not_statutory
  definition reviewedByAssociation under condition
    addressee = AssociationOfCitizens
    and isStatutoryActivity = Yes
    and appealType <> Complaint
    consequence equals Yes

  label default_not_statutory
  definition reviewedByAssociation equals No

  label this_law_exception default_not_this_law
  definition reviewedUnderThisLaw under condition
    addressee = AssociationOfCitizens
    and rightsViolatedByAssociation = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label default_not_this_law
  definition reviewedUnderThisLaw equals No
```

## Article 12. Scope of application of this Law

```catala
declaration scope Article12Scope:
  input appealType content AppealType
  input isCriminalProcedure content YesNo
  input isCivilProcedure content YesNo
  input isLaborLaw content YesNo
  input isCompetitionLaw content YesNo
  input isAdministrativeCourt content YesNo
  input isJudiciaryLaw content YesNo
  input isCourtDecisionsAccess content YesNo
  input isAntiCorruption content YesNo
  input isEnforcement content YesNo
  input isAdministrativeProcedure content YesNo
  input isMilitaryOmbudsman content YesNo
  input isDepositGuarantee content YesNo
  output excludedFromScope content YesNo
  output fallsUnderAdministrativeProcedure content YesNo
  output fallsUnderMilitaryOmbudsman content YesNo

scope Article12Scope:
  label excluded_exception default_not_excluded
  definition excludedFromScope under condition
    isCriminalProcedure = Yes
    or isCivilProcedure = Yes
    or isLaborLaw = Yes
    or isCompetitionLaw = Yes
    or isAdministrativeCourt = Yes
    or isJudiciaryLaw = Yes
    or isCourtDecisionsAccess = Yes
    or isAntiCorruption = Yes
    or isEnforcement = Yes
    or isDepositGuarantee = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label default_not_excluded
  definition excludedFromScope equals No

  label admin_proc_exception default_not_admin_proc
  definition fallsUnderAdministrativeProcedure under condition
    isAdministrativeProcedure = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label default_not_admin_proc
  definition fallsUnderAdministrativeProcedure equals No

  label military_ombudsman_exception default_not_military_ombudsman
  definition fallsUnderMilitaryOmbudsman under condition
    isMilitaryOmbudsman = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label default_not_military_ombudsman
  definition fallsUnderMilitaryOmbudsman equals No
```

## Article 13. Record-keeping on citizens' appeals

```catala
declaration scope Article13RecordKeeping:
  input appealSubmitted content YesNo
  input recordEstablished content YesNo
  output recordKeepingRequired content YesNo
  output recordKeepingCompliant content YesNo

scope Article13RecordKeeping:
  label record_required
  definition recordKeepingRequired equals Yes

  label record_compliant_exception default_not_compliant
  definition recordKeepingCompliant under condition
    appealSubmitted = Yes and recordEstablished = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label default_not_compliant
  definition recordKeepingCompliant equals No
```
